       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CALL-SUB-EX.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-A PIC 9(3) VALUE 7.
       01 WS-B PIC 9(3) VALUE 5.
       01 WS-R PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL "ADDER" USING WS-A WS-B WS-R.
           DISPLAY "RESULT=" WS-R.
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM CALL-SUB-EX.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ADDER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 L-A PIC 9(3).
       01 L-B PIC 9(3).
       01 L-R PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-A L-B L-R.
           ADD L-A TO L-B GIVING L-R.
           EXIT PROGRAM.
       END PROGRAM ADDER.
